{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05908","headline":"偶然作六首 三 · 王维","name":"偶然作六首 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"日夕见太行，沈吟未能去。\n问君何以然，世网婴我故。\n小妹日成长，兄弟未有娶。\n家贫禄既薄，储蓄非有素。\n几回欲奋飞，踟蹰复相顾。\n孙登长啸台，松竹有遗处。\n相去讵几许，故人在中路。\n爱染日已薄，禅寂日已固。\n忽乎吾将行，宁俟岁云暮。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王维","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05908.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05908","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}